# Derived KG/corpus artifacts of one earlier pipeline run. The folder's script,
# run_eval_final.py, was removed with the retrieval layer on 2026-11-10; it opened exactly two
# files from export/ (corpus.jsonl and graph-hyperedges.kv), and those two stay tracked as dated
# records (see SOURCE.md). The six below were 110 MB of pipeline output with no reader anywhere
# in the repository, and no in-tree config regenerates them; they are a snapshot of one run,
# not a fixture.
export/corpus.parquet
export/graph-nodes.parquet
export/graph-edges.parquet
export/graph-hyperedges.parquet
export/graph.ttl
export/graph.graphml
__pycache__/
